Now write drawScareFace in main.js and call. Add near helpers or boot. Use canvas 2D.

Let's craft detailed drawing.

Pseudo:
```
function drawScareFace(){
 const c=document.getElementById('scare-canvas'); const ctx=c.getContext('2d'); const W=512,H=768;
 ctx.clearRect
 // hair background
 ctx.fillStyle='#030404'; irregular blob covering full except some edges:
 path from 0,768 to 0,120 bezier ... top etc to 512...
 fill
 // hair texture strands (dark grey lines)
 // face clipped
 const facePath = new Path2D(); ...
 ctx.save(); ctx.clip(facePath);
 // skin gradient
 const g=ctx.createRadialGradient(256,280,40,256,420,340)...
 fillRect
 // mottling noise (random translucent patches)
 // temple and cheek shadows
 // forehead lines
 // eye sockets
 function socket(cx,cy,rx,ry,rot) { save translate rotate; radial gradient black; ellipse fill; ...}
 // pupils red
 // tear streaks
 // nose
 // mouth: black shape
 // teeth
 // lower lip
 // veins
 // face edge shadow
 ctx.restore();
 // hair strands over face
 // overall grunge noise
 // vignette
}
```
Need be careful with Path2D clip from coordinates.

Colors:
skin gradient: top #b9bcab, mid #a7aa9a, lower #7c8177, edges dark.
Use radial from (220,220) light: rgba(215,216,198,1) to #6d7268.

Eye sockets at y 295. Face center x256. Eyes x=207 and 305. sockets 62x48. Draw outer dark socket with shadowBlur 20 black; inner pure black; red pupil at x+5,y+3 radius 7 with shadowBlur 18 red. Maybe add small white glint.

Tears: from eye lower edge down to jaw, semi-transparent black streaks. Draw several wavy lines.

Nose: slender dark shape at 256,330-400: two nostrils at 390.

Mouth: center x256, open from y 440 to 640, width 160. Path:
move 200,450; bezier 210,430 230,425 256,430; bezier 280,425 305,435 315,455; bezier 305,520 320,580 300,620; bezier 285,655 227,655 212,620; bezier 195,580 208,520 200,450. Fill dark gradient. Add lips outer outline dark maroon. Teeth: upper 5 triangles down from y455 to 505, lower 4 up from y640? The mouth opening lower to 620. Draw teeth with off-white color #b7b09b, shading.

Hair strands over face: black curved lines from y120 sides over cheeks. Add 10.

Forehead veins: dim blue-grey lines.

Grunge: 300 random specks dark/light.

Vignette: radial dark edges.

Maybe face too bright. Final filter contrast. Good.

Let's add.

